{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04558","headline":"赠赵公 · 张说","name":"赠赵公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘东股肱守，心与帝乡期。\n舟楫中途蹇，风波复来思。\n嘉我常联翼，金貂侍玉墀。\n迹参前马圣，名缀鬻熊师。\n寒暑一何速，山川远间之。\n宁知洞庭上，独得平生时。\n精意微绝简，从权讨妙棋。\n林壑爲予请，纷霭发华滋。\n流赏忽已散，惊帆杳难追。\n送君在南浦，侘傺投此词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04558.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04558","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}